  title: Civil Disobedience Movement
  text: "After the Lahore Congress demanded Purna Swaraj, complete independence, in 1929, Gandhi began the Civil Disobedience Movement in 1930, urging people to break unjust laws. It paused with the Gandhi\u2013Irwin Pact of 1931 and resumed in 1932."
